WEBVTT

00:35.952 --> 00:37.787
- Hello.
- Hi.

00:37.871 --> 00:39.330
- This is your second child?
- Yes.

00:39.414 --> 00:41.124
He's a sturdy-looking fellow.

00:42.125 --> 00:43.042
She is a baby girl.

00:46.129 --> 00:47.964
But Hee-kyung is so pretty…

00:49.174 --> 00:50.717
How are you so pretty, Hee-kyung?

00:50.800 --> 00:52.594
She'll run for Miss Korea, right?

00:56.347 --> 00:59.601
Ever since I was young,
I could tell from the looks people gave me

01:00.727 --> 01:02.479
that I'm not pretty.

01:02.562 --> 01:03.480
General.

01:03.563 --> 01:05.482
- General!
- You did it, Grandpa!

01:05.565 --> 01:07.442
- Can you take that back?
- No.

01:07.525 --> 01:10.361
- Please take that back.
- No way!

01:10.445 --> 01:12.781
In Korean chess, what's done is done.

01:12.864 --> 01:14.199
- How did it go? Who won?
- No takebacks.

01:14.282 --> 01:15.909
- Really?
- I can't take it back.

01:15.992 --> 01:16.910
By the way,

01:16.993 --> 01:20.830
how is it that Ju-kyung
solely takes after her mom's side?

01:20.914 --> 01:23.083
She'd be better off
if she had Jae-pil's eyes.

01:23.166 --> 01:25.418
- Consider getting her plastic surgery.
- Come on.

01:25.502 --> 01:26.753
- Don't say that.
- Honey.

01:26.836 --> 01:29.339
- She doesn't look like our family.
- Father!

01:29.422 --> 01:31.633
- Grandpa!
- You'll hurt her feelings.

01:34.052 --> 01:37.096
Your grades are all that matter, got it?

01:46.523 --> 01:50.318
Cartoons had me dreaming
of a magical transformation

01:50.401 --> 01:54.155
where an average-looking girl
turns into a pretty fairy in a flash.

01:57.325 --> 01:59.369
- What the heck?
- What is that?

01:59.452 --> 02:00.703
- What is she?
- What is that?

02:00.787 --> 02:02.997
She must think she's a fairy or something.

02:03.081 --> 02:04.749
She thinks she's a princess.

02:04.833 --> 02:06.543
Now, turn into an ugly monster!

02:06.626 --> 02:08.545
Go away, you monster!

02:44.038 --> 02:47.041
That was when I realized…

02:47.125 --> 02:48.501
CURSED MASK

02:48.585 --> 02:52.755
…I'm more of a heroine
with a cursed mask in horror comics

02:54.048 --> 02:55.758
rather than a girl in romance comics.

03:03.683 --> 03:07.186
CURSED MASK

03:22.201 --> 03:23.745
The depiction of the professor

03:23.828 --> 03:28.041
who throws himself into meaningless work
reports on modern society's absurdity.

03:28.124 --> 03:31.127
Let's look at the question below.
You'll find different types.

03:31.210 --> 03:33.129
Among them, number one is…

03:33.212 --> 03:34.964
I didn't realize it was time already.

03:35.048 --> 03:38.218
Hand in the homework by tomorrow.
That's it for today.

03:38.301 --> 03:39.552
- Okay.
- Let's hit the snack bar.

03:40.136 --> 03:41.262
Let's go.

03:41.346 --> 03:43.056
- Hey, Sam-mi.
- Got it.

03:49.312 --> 03:50.563
My hair got flat.

03:50.647 --> 03:52.440
Who told you to sleep in class?

03:52.941 --> 03:54.943
- Goodness.
- I'm sorry!

03:55.026 --> 03:57.153
- What are you doing?
- You're here.

03:57.237 --> 03:58.071
What?

03:58.154 --> 03:59.530
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

04:04.786 --> 04:06.371
Would you like to read this?

04:07.163 --> 04:08.248
Not sure.

04:13.795 --> 04:15.505
Would you like to listen to this?

04:15.588 --> 04:16.965
Not sure.

04:23.888 --> 04:25.598
Sam-mi, I want to try your lip tint.

04:25.682 --> 04:27.934
Using her lip tint won't do you any good.

04:28.017 --> 04:29.269
Not doing it for you, am I?

04:29.936 --> 04:31.104
You're pissing me off.

04:31.187 --> 04:32.647
Hey, look at her.

04:35.608 --> 04:38.278
- What is she doing?
- How ridiculous.

04:38.361 --> 04:39.320
Hey, Dumpling.

04:41.406 --> 04:43.199
- Hey, Dumpling.
- Hey, Dumpling.

04:45.576 --> 04:46.953
Hey, Dumpling!

04:47.996 --> 04:49.122
Did you call me?

04:49.205 --> 04:51.207
Who else is called Dumpling here?

04:51.916 --> 04:53.918
What's up?
Don't you have an errand to run?

04:54.002 --> 04:56.170
You mean, now? Got it.

04:56.254 --> 04:59.007
She's going to do the delivery.
She's a professional.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.842
A professional dumpling courier.

05:14.689 --> 05:16.816
Two with meat and one with kimchi, right?

05:18.401 --> 05:19.944
Enjoy your snacks, kids.

05:20.028 --> 05:21.863
- I--
- Ma'am, two dumplings.

05:23.323 --> 05:25.033
It's my turn.

05:25.116 --> 05:26.034
- What the…
- Jeez.

05:26.117 --> 05:27.535
Here you go. Enjoy!

05:27.618 --> 05:28.453
- Thanks!
- Thanks!

05:29.537 --> 05:31.205
- Two with meat and--
- One with kimchi, right?

05:31.789 --> 05:32.707
Yes.

05:34.625 --> 05:35.626
Thank you.

05:36.294 --> 05:37.503
Hey, you came!

05:52.560 --> 05:54.896
Is Hyun-bin not here yet?

06:10.328 --> 06:11.537
Hey, girl.

06:12.580 --> 06:13.581
Hyun-bin.

06:14.832 --> 06:15.833
Wait, is this…

06:16.375 --> 06:17.210
Crash?

06:17.919 --> 06:19.921
I knew you'd get it right away.

06:20.004 --> 06:22.799
Of course. This one's a classic.

06:22.882 --> 06:26.552
Just as I thought.
You and I have the same musical taste.

06:28.096 --> 06:29.055
One moment.

06:37.897 --> 06:39.232
You're so dreamy.

06:43.861 --> 06:46.489
Now that's what I'm talking about.

06:49.033 --> 06:51.702
Calm down, heart. Stop acting up.

06:51.786 --> 06:53.579
Stop acting up.

07:00.503 --> 07:02.004
Stop acting up!

07:03.339 --> 07:04.465
Sorry, what did you say?

07:07.468 --> 07:09.011
Nothing.

07:09.512 --> 07:11.013
- Get it.
- Hey!

07:11.097 --> 07:14.016
- Jeez.
- Where's Dumpling?

07:14.100 --> 07:16.102
Is she making the dumplings herself?

07:16.185 --> 07:17.812
Goodness, look at her.

07:17.895 --> 07:19.355
Why? What is it?

07:19.439 --> 07:20.857
- What is it?
- What?

07:20.940 --> 07:22.191
Who is that person?

07:22.942 --> 07:24.277
Isn't that the guy

07:24.360 --> 07:26.529
who always flirts with you
at the cafeteria?

07:27.196 --> 07:29.991
Maybe they have something in common.

07:36.539 --> 07:38.749
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thanks.

07:41.752 --> 07:44.922
Isn't Hyun-bin so dreamy?

07:45.631 --> 07:46.466
Not sure.

07:46.549 --> 07:48.801
He said we have
the same taste in music earlier,

07:48.885 --> 07:50.636
and he smiled at me just now.

07:50.720 --> 07:53.264
Don't you think he likes me a little?

07:54.432 --> 07:55.933
Not sure.

07:56.017 --> 07:58.060
I'll tell him how I feel tomorrow.

07:59.020 --> 08:00.146
Great idea, right?

08:01.439 --> 08:02.773
Not sure.

08:02.857 --> 08:04.317
Hey, look at Ju-kyung.

08:04.400 --> 08:05.985
Black tights with white socks.

08:06.068 --> 08:07.111
- Horrifying. Hey.
- What?

08:07.195 --> 08:08.988
Would you date her for ten million won?

08:09.947 --> 08:12.158
- Not even for a hundred million won.
- Me neither.

08:13.784 --> 08:15.620
I'll have my lunch later.

08:15.703 --> 08:16.579
What?

08:18.539 --> 08:19.749
Come on, move.

08:23.419 --> 08:24.754
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thank you.

08:25.880 --> 08:27.215
- Come on.
- The kimchi looks great.

08:27.298 --> 08:28.174
Thank you.

08:29.967 --> 08:31.010
Enjoy your meal.

08:33.095 --> 08:34.305
Hey, Hyun-bin.

08:35.473 --> 08:39.852
Can we meet up for a second
during tomorrow's lunch hour?

08:41.437 --> 08:42.355
Tomorrow?

08:43.189 --> 08:44.065
Sure.

08:44.148 --> 08:45.942
Hey, look at Dumpling.

08:51.447 --> 08:53.574
She's really trying to make a move?

09:32.321 --> 09:33.698
Do it harder.

09:33.781 --> 09:35.575
What brought you out, son?

09:35.658 --> 09:37.451
- Are you hungry? Want some fruit?
- No.

09:40.871 --> 09:41.789
Lim Ju-kyung.

09:41.872 --> 09:44.667
What were you doing in the kitchen
instead of studying?

09:44.750 --> 09:46.127
I just worked on some things.

09:46.210 --> 09:48.379
You should work on your grades.

09:48.462 --> 09:50.381
Your last test scores dropped again--

09:50.464 --> 09:52.091
Fine. I'll work on it.

09:52.174 --> 09:54.719
Lim Ju-kyung! I'm still talking.
Where are you going?

09:54.802 --> 09:57.638
She said she's got it.
Let me get your neck.

09:57.722 --> 10:00.933
I don't get who she takes after.

10:05.229 --> 10:08.441
- Come on, do my left side.
- Okay.

10:13.321 --> 10:16.449
I CAN'T WAIT ANY LONGER.
CAN YOU RETURN MY INVESTMENT?

10:16.532 --> 10:18.618
Focus.

10:18.701 --> 10:20.411
Yes, one second.

10:20.494 --> 10:21.746
The door is open.

10:21.829 --> 10:23.998
- My daughter, you're home!
- Yes.

10:24.999 --> 10:27.376
I need to go now, right now.

10:27.460 --> 10:29.295
Number one? Number two?

10:30.463 --> 10:31.964
Number two.

10:32.048 --> 10:34.091
- I'm in here!
- Hey, you little…

10:34.175 --> 10:36.802
I could make you eat my hot dump!

10:38.137 --> 10:40.806
- Use the one in the master bedroom.
- Master bedroom…

10:40.890 --> 10:42.308
- It's coming.
- Hold it in.

10:42.391 --> 10:44.852
- It's coming.
- Don't move too much.

10:44.935 --> 10:46.437
Don't forget to breathe.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.521
Try Lamaze breathing.

10:54.111 --> 10:55.154
ABANDONED CHILD
WITCH'S TALE

10:59.575 --> 11:01.118
METAL METAL BAND CONCERT TICKET

11:05.247 --> 11:07.041
TO HYUN-BIN

11:07.124 --> 11:08.918
"You are a dummy."

11:09.502 --> 11:12.046
"A dummy for not knowing
how I feel about you."

11:12.129 --> 11:15.549
"And I'm a dummy
for only thinking about you."

11:16.842 --> 11:19.720
"You dummy.
Of course, I know how you feel."

11:20.388 --> 11:21.847
My gosh!

11:23.391 --> 11:26.185
"Will you be my girlfriend
starting today?"

11:32.817 --> 11:34.568
Hey, Lim Ju-bal, keep the music…

11:36.028 --> 11:38.239
I want to poke my eyes out!

11:40.324 --> 11:41.325
What's wrong with her?

11:50.000 --> 11:51.836
JEONG SE-YEON, I'LL ALWAYS
KEEP YOU IN MY HEART

11:51.919 --> 11:53.421
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SE-YEON.
HOPE YOU ARE HAPPY IN HEAVEN.

11:54.755 --> 11:56.507
His fans are funny.

11:56.590 --> 11:58.759
Didn't they all trash-talk him
before his death?

11:59.468 --> 12:01.220
And now they are pretending to be sad?

12:01.303 --> 12:02.930
They're so two-faced.

12:04.515 --> 12:07.226
I'm going to tell my crush
how I feel today.

12:07.309 --> 12:08.811
I'm so nervous.

12:08.894 --> 12:10.187
Cheer me on for courage.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.898
I'm so nervous.

12:13.607 --> 12:15.484
I admire your courage. You can do it!

12:15.985 --> 12:17.903
I hope he likes you back!

12:17.987 --> 12:19.238
LET US KNOW HOW IT GOES

12:37.548 --> 12:40.301
- Hey. Seriously, stop it.
- Watch it.

12:45.598 --> 12:46.640
Jeez.

12:48.517 --> 12:49.810
Hey, Sam-mi is here.

12:49.894 --> 12:52.480
- Really?
- Where? Let me see.

12:52.563 --> 12:54.773
- It's really Sam-mi.
- Let her through.

12:55.816 --> 12:58.652
- She looks prettier in person.
- She's beautiful.

13:00.863 --> 13:02.114
Hey, give Sam-mi your seat.

13:02.198 --> 13:03.449
Sam-mi, you can sit here.

13:03.532 --> 13:05.034
- She's so stunning.
- Look at her.

13:05.117 --> 13:06.285
Her look is unmatched.

13:07.745 --> 13:08.829
I can't believe this.

13:12.124 --> 13:13.417
What? She sat on his lap?

13:13.501 --> 13:14.585
What is this?

13:14.668 --> 13:15.586
What the heck?

13:17.046 --> 13:18.839
I'm sorry.

13:29.058 --> 13:30.142
What the…

13:30.726 --> 13:32.645
- Hey.
- I'll get you the dumplings.

13:35.523 --> 13:36.732
What was that?

13:38.567 --> 13:40.319
- Look what she brought.
- What?

13:40.402 --> 13:42.947
- Dumpling brought something?
- What's this?

13:44.031 --> 13:46.242
What? Cookies?

13:46.909 --> 13:48.327
- So ugly.
- Looks tacky.

13:48.410 --> 13:49.537
At least she tried.

13:50.788 --> 13:52.373
"You are a dummy."

13:52.456 --> 13:54.166
"A dummy for not knowing
how I feel about you."

13:54.250 --> 13:56.001
"I'm a dummy too."

13:56.085 --> 13:58.420
Jeez, the lines are so lame.

13:59.255 --> 14:00.798
- Hey.
- Yes?

14:00.881 --> 14:02.424
Is she asking him out today?

14:03.342 --> 14:04.176
Well…

14:04.260 --> 14:06.136
Can't even get a word out?

14:06.720 --> 14:08.556
I guess like attracts like.

14:16.146 --> 14:17.356
Hyun-bin.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.233
Yes, Sam-mi. What's up?

14:19.316 --> 14:20.192
Are you busy?

14:21.110 --> 14:22.736
Do you have something to say to me?

14:23.320 --> 14:24.363
Well…

14:25.239 --> 14:28.659
Are you dating Lim Ju-kyung?

14:28.742 --> 14:29.577
What?

14:30.494 --> 14:33.622
- Why do you ask?
- I was shocked when I heard the rumor.

14:33.706 --> 14:35.749
You are like clean spring water,

14:35.833 --> 14:40.212
and she's like sewer water way downstream.

14:41.088 --> 14:43.757
You are way out of her league.

14:43.841 --> 14:46.010
Yes, of course.

14:46.093 --> 14:47.761
She must have mistaken your kindness

14:47.845 --> 14:50.431
and thought that she had a shot.

14:50.514 --> 14:51.390
Right?

14:52.057 --> 14:53.684
I know I'm too nice.

14:53.767 --> 14:54.643
To be honest,

14:54.727 --> 14:57.855
the rumor that you're
going out with Ju-kyung

14:57.938 --> 14:59.565
really broke my heart.

15:01.692 --> 15:05.571
I'm the bad guy for making you upset.
Seriously, it's unforgivable.

15:05.654 --> 15:07.573
Hyun-bin, you bad guy!

15:07.656 --> 15:10.117
Hyun-bin, don't do that.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.453
You could hurt your handsome face.

15:13.787 --> 15:17.082
I'll see you again later.

15:17.166 --> 15:18.542
Later when?

15:18.626 --> 15:20.419
Today? I have some time now too.

15:20.502 --> 15:21.337
Right now…

15:21.879 --> 15:23.422
Perhaps soon?

15:23.505 --> 15:24.340
All right, Sam-mi.

15:24.423 --> 15:25.883
I'll DM you. See you soon.

15:25.966 --> 15:27.009
Yes, let's.

15:29.511 --> 15:30.679
I'll send you a message!

15:30.763 --> 15:33.432
- That was so easy.
- So naive.

15:39.229 --> 15:40.230
MORNING CARE

15:40.314 --> 15:41.440
AESTHETICIAN LICENSE

15:43.734 --> 15:45.611
Done. Perfect!

15:45.694 --> 15:49.073
Both brows are symmetrical
like a decalcomania.

15:49.156 --> 15:52.326
Your eye is as keen as ever.

15:53.077 --> 15:55.829
- Can I have some coffee before I go?
- Of course, dear client.

15:56.497 --> 15:59.833
Now, let me see.

16:00.501 --> 16:02.628
It came out too subtle last time.

16:03.295 --> 16:05.673
Natural and subtle are very on-trend.

16:05.756 --> 16:07.508
But I want them to be noticeable.

16:07.591 --> 16:11.637
All right, just leave them to me.

16:14.014 --> 16:16.934
By the way, your handsome husband
hasn't been around lately.

16:17.017 --> 16:19.770
I'm not sure what he's up to.

16:19.853 --> 16:22.398
He's on the phone at all times.

16:23.065 --> 16:25.192
Maybe he's having an affair.

16:25.275 --> 16:26.694
Let him have an affair.

16:26.777 --> 16:28.946
I'm okay as long as it's not about money.

16:34.618 --> 16:36.495
What is it? You want your eyebrows done?

16:36.578 --> 16:37.955
Who's Lim Jae-pil's wife?

16:45.462 --> 16:46.755
What is this?

16:47.423 --> 16:49.258
These are concert tickets,

16:50.300 --> 16:52.344
cookies I've made,

16:53.012 --> 16:54.596
- and…
- And what?

16:56.849 --> 16:57.808
And…

17:01.186 --> 17:02.354
my heart.

17:04.773 --> 17:06.233
Hyun-bin, I like you.

17:06.316 --> 17:07.276
What?

17:08.527 --> 17:10.404
Are you asking me out or something?

17:14.033 --> 17:15.826
I'm Hyun-bin.

17:15.909 --> 17:16.785
Wang Hyun-bin.

17:18.037 --> 17:19.038
Sorry?

17:20.914 --> 17:21.749
Okay.

17:23.208 --> 17:25.919
You thought I would date you
if you said you liked me?

17:28.213 --> 17:31.884
You told me
I'm a good person the other day,

17:32.634 --> 17:34.261
and we have the same taste.

17:34.344 --> 17:35.220
Hey.

17:35.888 --> 17:38.766
I took pity on you for being bullied.
Is this how you repay me?

17:39.516 --> 17:40.350
Hey.

17:41.185 --> 17:43.896
If you don't have the looks,
you should at least be sharp-witted.

17:43.979 --> 17:45.189
Know your place.

17:50.277 --> 17:52.154
Instead of wasting your time like this,

17:53.197 --> 17:54.531
take a look in the mirror.

18:06.877 --> 18:09.922
- You're recording this, right?
- Gosh, poor Dumpling.

18:10.005 --> 18:14.009
So that's how the ugliest person
in our school confessed her feelings.

18:14.093 --> 18:15.719
A round of applause, everyone!

18:19.848 --> 18:23.060
Let's hear your thoughts
on being crushed by your crush.

18:23.143 --> 18:24.144
- Let's hear it.
- Let's hear it.

18:26.313 --> 18:29.024
Goodness, you look really ugly on camera.

18:29.108 --> 18:31.110
- Hey, come on tell us.
- Stop it.

18:31.193 --> 18:32.486
You're already in the video.

18:32.569 --> 18:33.654
Come on, say something.

18:33.737 --> 18:35.072
I said, stop it.

18:35.864 --> 18:37.658
- "I said, stop it."
- Hey.

18:37.741 --> 18:39.701
Who do you think you're pushing?

18:39.785 --> 18:40.869
Have you lost it?

18:58.679 --> 19:02.182
Why do you hate me so much?

19:09.940 --> 19:11.483
Why do you hate me?

19:13.068 --> 19:16.113
I haven't done anything wrong to you,

19:16.864 --> 19:19.449
but why do you hate me so much?

19:25.956 --> 19:26.790
Hey.

19:28.834 --> 19:30.627
Do you really want to know?

19:33.255 --> 19:36.967
Because you are ugly.

19:38.886 --> 19:40.345
You have cooties now.

19:40.429 --> 19:42.598
- Right.
- Don't come near me.

19:42.681 --> 19:44.224
- I forgot about that.
- Don't be ridiculous.

19:44.308 --> 19:45.350
- Come on.
- Stop it.

19:45.434 --> 19:47.728
- That was just like her. Do it again.
- "Stop it."

19:47.811 --> 19:49.438
Did you see how she fell earlier?

19:50.772 --> 19:52.024
"I said, stop it."

19:52.941 --> 19:54.735
- Where is she going?
- "I said, stop it."

19:54.818 --> 19:55.736
Where are you going?

19:55.819 --> 19:58.864
- "I said, stop it."
- Look at her crying. I hate it.

19:58.947 --> 19:59.781
Whatever.

20:05.871 --> 20:07.122
YONGPA HIGH ANONYMOUS FORUM

20:07.206 --> 20:09.833
The guy is lousy too.
She has neither looks nor good taste.

20:09.917 --> 20:12.419
- She's the ugliest girl at school.
- She has confidence despite her looks.

20:12.502 --> 20:14.588
How is she going to
show her face at school?

20:17.716 --> 20:18.800
Damn it!

21:01.969 --> 21:04.012
Instead of wasting your time like this,

21:04.096 --> 21:05.639
take a look in the mirror.

21:06.515 --> 21:09.434
If you don't have the looks,
you should at least be sharp-witted.

21:09.518 --> 21:10.811
Know your place.

21:10.894 --> 21:13.939
Because you are ugly.

21:45.887 --> 21:47.472
Look, everyone.

21:47.556 --> 21:49.808
Here comes our superstar!

21:52.269 --> 21:56.231
- Troll!
- Troll!

21:56.315 --> 21:58.150
- Troll!
- Guys, look at that!

22:01.361 --> 22:06.658
- Troll!
- Troll!

22:06.742 --> 22:12.706
- Troll!
- Troll!

22:17.085 --> 22:19.588
Nobody likes me.

22:23.258 --> 22:26.053
How can I possibly go to school tomorrow?

24:14.661 --> 24:17.247
WE MISS YOU AND LOVE YOU

24:17.330 --> 24:20.083
CELEBRATING THE 18TH BIRTHDAY
OF JEONG SE-YEON

24:23.503 --> 24:27.257
CELEBRATING THE 18TH BIRTHDAY
OF JEONG SE-YEON

24:29.217 --> 24:30.802
What a shame.

24:32.470 --> 24:33.847
He was only 18.

24:47.736 --> 24:48.653
I…

24:53.283 --> 24:55.035
I don't want to die.

25:00.624 --> 25:02.083
It's so cold.

25:49.673 --> 25:51.007
What a relief.

26:21.288 --> 26:22.789
What was that about?

26:24.708 --> 26:25.625
My glasses.

26:26.376 --> 26:27.544
Where are they?

26:28.753 --> 26:29.963
My glasses.

26:32.966 --> 26:33.800
My glasses.

26:34.801 --> 26:36.761
I can't see anything without my glasses.

26:37.262 --> 26:38.430
Where are they?

26:39.431 --> 26:40.890
What were you doing?

26:43.310 --> 26:44.227
Were you going to jump?

26:46.438 --> 26:47.522
Are you crazy?

26:48.398 --> 26:49.733
Are you out of your mind?

26:50.984 --> 26:53.361
Why would you do that?
What's troubling you so badly?

26:54.696 --> 26:56.239
Why would you make such a choice?

26:56.823 --> 26:58.241
I wasn't going to kill--

26:58.325 --> 26:59.993
Face your life with such courage.

27:01.953 --> 27:04.581
Haven't you thought of
the people you'd leave behind

27:06.124 --> 27:08.168
and how much they would grieve?

27:09.002 --> 27:10.712
- Well…
- Someone out there

27:11.504 --> 27:13.715
might suffer forever with guilt…

27:15.759 --> 27:17.427
for failing to save you.

27:20.555 --> 27:21.806
Did you think about that?

27:29.814 --> 27:31.149
There's nothing you can do…

27:32.442 --> 27:33.818
for a dead person.

27:36.279 --> 27:37.489
So don't do it.

28:02.055 --> 28:02.889
What?

28:03.431 --> 28:04.933
Are you going to jump after I leave?

28:07.227 --> 28:08.061
No.

28:08.895 --> 28:09.938
Well…

28:10.605 --> 28:12.273
Hold on.

28:13.316 --> 28:14.526
My glasses.

28:19.197 --> 28:20.615
My glasses. Wait up!

28:20.698 --> 28:22.033
ELEVATOR MAINTENANCE CHECK

28:30.333 --> 28:31.835
What is it?

28:31.918 --> 28:33.420
Is it out of order?

28:34.212 --> 28:36.047
Wait for me, sir.

28:38.758 --> 28:40.927
Wait for me.

28:43.138 --> 28:44.431
Wait up.

28:45.557 --> 28:47.350
I lost my glasses because of you

28:47.434 --> 28:49.769
and can't see anything.

28:51.062 --> 28:53.064
My prescription is negative eight.

28:55.608 --> 28:57.193
Without my glasses,

28:58.069 --> 28:59.863
I can't tell what's what.

29:19.799 --> 29:21.384
Hey.

29:21.468 --> 29:22.927
Are you still there?

29:26.473 --> 29:28.850
He really must be gone.

29:30.852 --> 29:34.230
What's with my life?

29:44.783 --> 29:45.867
What?

29:48.661 --> 29:50.872
You didn't leave?

29:51.372 --> 29:52.874
Hold my hand and get up.

29:53.458 --> 29:54.375
Okay.

30:03.092 --> 30:04.844
Watch where you're grabbing!

30:06.554 --> 30:11.643
I didn't do it on purpose.

30:15.188 --> 30:16.397
Just get on my back.

30:23.112 --> 30:24.239
Thank you.

30:33.832 --> 30:37.418
I'm heavier than I look, right, sir?

30:39.295 --> 30:40.630
You look heavy too.

30:41.214 --> 30:42.715
Why are you calling me "sir"?

30:56.229 --> 30:57.272
Excuse me.

30:58.898 --> 31:00.692
I have a question, sir.

31:00.775 --> 31:02.777
Why were you also up on the--

31:02.861 --> 31:03.695
Ma'am,

31:04.279 --> 31:05.780
just speak up.

31:06.990 --> 31:09.158
It echoes if I don't whisper.

31:09.242 --> 31:10.076
It's scary.

31:10.159 --> 31:13.162
And don't call me "ma'am."
I'm wearing a school uniform.

31:19.002 --> 31:20.545
Did someone you know

31:21.379 --> 31:23.965
jump from a rooftop?

31:27.218 --> 31:29.012
I'm just saying.

31:29.095 --> 31:32.765
We don't even know each other,
but you saved me and got so angry.

31:32.849 --> 31:35.310
That's why I wondered
if someone close to you had died.

31:36.394 --> 31:38.062
If you say one more word,

31:38.730 --> 31:40.189
I'll drop you right here.

31:46.195 --> 31:48.072
How are you so heavy?

31:50.074 --> 31:53.077
You can do it!

31:53.161 --> 31:53.995
Ma'am!

31:54.078 --> 31:55.788
Okay, I'll stop.

31:55.872 --> 31:57.916
I'm shutting up.

32:15.141 --> 32:15.975
Sir,

32:17.352 --> 32:18.561
wasn't it out of order?

32:20.104 --> 32:21.731
It was just a maintenance check.

32:21.814 --> 32:23.358
You didn't hear the announcement?

32:27.695 --> 32:29.989
Maybe we should have waited.

32:45.421 --> 32:46.881
Excuse me, sir!

32:51.135 --> 32:52.220
Seriously?

32:54.180 --> 32:55.098
What is it?

32:57.642 --> 32:58.518
Well…

32:59.727 --> 33:02.772
I know I'm not in a place
to be saying this…

33:06.567 --> 33:07.568
but hang in there.

33:11.406 --> 33:12.865
The dead…

33:14.450 --> 33:18.496
wouldn't have wanted the people
they left behind to suffer for too long.

33:21.666 --> 33:23.668
So please be happy.

33:23.751 --> 33:25.586
You have to be.

33:30.341 --> 33:32.552
- Sir, please take me to Bucheon.
- Okay.

33:46.566 --> 33:47.942
Why did you go even up there

33:48.026 --> 33:50.361
when you don't have the courage to do it,
you idiot?

33:50.945 --> 33:53.698
Darn it, those were fairly new glasses.

33:53.781 --> 33:55.533
Mom's going to be furious.

33:57.994 --> 34:00.872
After the beep,
your call will be forwarded to voicemail

34:00.955 --> 34:02.457
and will be charged accordingly.

34:03.708 --> 34:06.669
Mom, I wanted to hear your voice.

34:09.964 --> 34:10.882
Never mind.

34:12.133 --> 34:13.468
I guess this is better.

34:15.720 --> 34:18.890
I don't think I could bring myself to die
after hearing your voice.

34:19.515 --> 34:21.476
Thanks for having me…

34:22.769 --> 34:26.147
and raising me for the last 18 years.

34:26.230 --> 34:30.193
I'll reincarnate as your daughter
again in my next life.

34:31.027 --> 34:32.570
I'll see you then.

34:33.988 --> 34:38.618
Please make me pretty
the next time you have me.

34:46.292 --> 34:47.251
Oh, no.

34:49.670 --> 34:51.005
What if she already heard it?

34:51.923 --> 34:53.007
She can't.

34:57.136 --> 34:59.263
Why won't she answer?

35:00.473 --> 35:02.266
Sir, can you drive faster, please?

35:02.350 --> 35:03.184
Sure.

35:03.976 --> 35:05.937
Pick it up, please.

35:06.020 --> 35:09.107
MY DAUGHTER JU-KYUNG

35:16.656 --> 35:19.784
Mom? Hey, take her to her room.

35:19.867 --> 35:20.827
Let go.

35:20.910 --> 35:21.828
You idiot.

35:21.911 --> 35:23.412
What's in the sea near Ulleungdo?

35:23.496 --> 35:25.206
A treasure ship? You bought that?

35:25.289 --> 35:28.209
It's not entirely unbelievable.

35:28.292 --> 35:30.044
Historically, in 1800…

35:30.128 --> 35:31.963
In 1905, during the Russo-Japanese War--

35:32.046 --> 35:34.132
Forget about the Russo-Japanese War.

35:34.215 --> 35:36.425
You and I are going to have a war!

35:36.509 --> 35:38.594
- Stop her! No!
- Wait! Mom, please!

35:38.678 --> 35:40.388
Mom, please don't!

35:40.471 --> 35:42.473
- Hey, hold her!
- Let go of me.

35:42.557 --> 35:45.726
It's a historical fact
that the cruiser Donskoi sank.

35:45.810 --> 35:48.062
My life is on the brink of sinking
because of you!

35:48.146 --> 35:51.566
Is half a billion won a petty sum to you,
you rotten bastard?

35:52.275 --> 35:54.193
Why did you invest
that kind of money there?

35:54.277 --> 35:57.488
How are you still living in a fantasy
at the age of 50?

35:57.572 --> 36:00.700
Dad, tell her you are sorry! Come on!

36:01.492 --> 36:03.911
- Come on!
- I'm really sorry.

36:03.995 --> 36:07.331
Hyun-sook, I'm sorry.
Please forgive me just for once.

36:07.415 --> 36:09.000
Forget it.

36:09.083 --> 36:11.377
I'll kill you tonight

36:11.460 --> 36:12.712
and gladly go to prison!

36:12.795 --> 36:13.921
No!

36:14.005 --> 36:15.506
Mom, hold on!

36:15.590 --> 36:16.674
- No!
- Don't!

36:16.757 --> 36:18.926
- Wait. I'm sorry!
- Mom!

36:19.010 --> 36:20.094
Hang on.

36:20.178 --> 36:21.179
- Freeze.
- Mom!

36:21.262 --> 36:22.680
- Stop.
- Hang on.

36:22.763 --> 36:24.724
Come here. You're holding out on me?

36:24.807 --> 36:26.601
- Calm down.
- How dare you.

36:28.811 --> 36:29.687
Look at that.

36:31.772 --> 36:32.690
Seriously?

38:03.572 --> 38:05.157
The dead…

38:05.241 --> 38:09.495
wouldn't have wanted the people
they left behind to suffer for too long.

38:10.162 --> 38:12.665
So please be happy.

38:38.774 --> 38:40.026
Stop crying.

38:40.109 --> 38:42.028
Mom!

38:42.111 --> 38:44.739
I'm going to off myself…

38:48.826 --> 38:49.827
Mom.

38:50.661 --> 38:53.122
Why would you say that?

38:53.205 --> 38:54.165
Hey, you're home.

38:57.585 --> 39:00.963
How can I possibly leave you guys behind?

39:05.092 --> 39:07.053
Let's just die together.

39:07.136 --> 39:07.970
All of us.

39:08.512 --> 39:10.389
- I won't say such things again.
- Together.

39:10.473 --> 39:11.557
Please don't cry.

39:11.640 --> 39:13.934
How could I not cry in this situation?

39:15.019 --> 39:17.938
Gosh, what's up with my life?

39:19.357 --> 39:22.026
Why didn't you make me pretty then?

39:22.109 --> 39:25.029
Hee-kyung and Ju-young take after Dad.

39:25.112 --> 39:27.239
That's why I did it!

39:28.366 --> 39:31.035
- What?
- Am I wrong?

39:31.118 --> 39:34.955
I'm the only one who's ugly
because I take after you!

39:35.581 --> 39:36.707
What did you just say?

39:36.791 --> 39:39.377
Hey, read the room.

39:39.460 --> 39:40.711
Lim Ju-bal, shut it.

39:40.795 --> 39:43.506
I won't kill myself,
so let me get plastic surgery.

39:43.589 --> 39:45.383
- Then everything will be okay.
- What?

39:46.050 --> 39:48.719
What's this nonsense?
I could kick you out too!

39:48.803 --> 39:51.847
You must also prefer a pretty daughter
to an ugly one!

39:51.931 --> 39:54.225
Don't add to my troubles. Leave.

39:54.308 --> 39:55.476
I said, leave!

39:55.559 --> 39:57.353
- Let me get surgery.
- Let's go.

39:57.436 --> 40:00.856
I want surgery.
I'm the only one who looks like you!

40:01.982 --> 40:03.859
- I want plastic surgery.
- Come on.

40:14.578 --> 40:17.665
HYE-MIN

40:30.386 --> 40:31.387
CHAT

40:31.470 --> 40:33.389
ARE YOU UP, HYE-MIN?
TODAY'S THE DAY!

40:34.807 --> 40:37.059
JUST THE THOUGHT OF IT MAKES ME NERVOUS…

40:37.643 --> 40:40.438
I must have been the only one
who thought we were friends.

40:43.524 --> 40:45.860
I really have no one starting tomorrow.

40:47.528 --> 40:48.946
I want to drop out.

40:51.115 --> 40:52.658
Hey, Ju-kyung.

40:54.869 --> 40:57.371
- Are you asleep?
- I'm about to.

40:58.330 --> 41:00.833
I'm taking Mom out for a drink,
so you sleep, okay?

41:09.967 --> 41:11.802
Why did I leave that voicemail?

41:11.886 --> 41:13.262
I just broke Mom's heart.

41:21.937 --> 41:22.771
After…

41:24.064 --> 41:25.483
we bought this apartment,

41:26.233 --> 41:28.611
I couldn't sleep for days
because I was so happy.

41:29.862 --> 41:31.697
- You're selling it?
- What else can I do?

41:32.531 --> 41:34.325
Selling our old place won't pay much

41:34.408 --> 41:36.035
seeing how nobody wants to rent it.

41:36.702 --> 41:38.579
We'll sell it, settle the debt,

41:38.662 --> 41:41.165
- and move back to our old place.
- Don't.

41:42.082 --> 41:45.252
I'll get my severance pay early,
take out some loans, and we'll be--

41:45.336 --> 41:46.420
Nonsense.

41:46.504 --> 41:48.547
He's my husband, so I'll settle it myself.

41:48.631 --> 41:50.049
It's not your problem.

41:51.467 --> 41:53.177
Let Dad come back home.

41:53.260 --> 41:55.346
Kicking him out in his underwear
in this cold is too harsh.

41:55.429 --> 41:56.263
Whatever.

41:56.347 --> 41:58.015
I don't care if he freezes to death.

41:58.766 --> 42:00.142
BEAUTY SALON

42:07.107 --> 42:08.817
Honey, I'm so sorry.

42:09.693 --> 42:10.819
Please stop.

42:20.829 --> 42:22.414
I'M GOING TO TELL MY CRUSH
HOW I FEEL TODAY…

42:23.749 --> 42:25.834
- I admire your courage.
- I hope he likes you back!

42:25.918 --> 42:26.752
Let us know how it goes.

42:26.835 --> 42:28.587
Did you do it?
Do you have a boyfriend now?

42:28.671 --> 42:30.256
Answer us! Where's your follow-up?

42:30.339 --> 42:34.426
Guys, I actually got rejected.

42:34.969 --> 42:40.349
No one likes me because I'm ugly.

42:40.432 --> 42:41.267
Oh, no.

42:41.350 --> 42:42.184
Focus on studying.

42:42.268 --> 42:44.228
A full-body makeover?
Plastic surgeons can reinvent you.

42:44.311 --> 42:47.565
My grades aren't good,
and my mom said no to plastic surgery.

42:50.234 --> 42:51.527
Are you good at makeup?

42:51.610 --> 42:53.487
You could totally make up for your looks.

42:53.571 --> 42:54.488
Check out this link.

42:54.572 --> 42:56.282
HOPE YOU ALL GET PRETTIER
AFTER WATCHING THE VIDEO

42:58.367 --> 43:00.035
MIRACULOUS MAKEUP, BEFORE AND AFTER

43:00.119 --> 43:01.120
TARGET YOUR CRUSH'S HEART

43:07.710 --> 43:08.752
This is unbelievable.

43:10.170 --> 43:11.380
This is it.

43:16.677 --> 43:17.553
What?

43:20.222 --> 43:21.599
- What?
- What the…

43:22.182 --> 43:23.934
- Why are they staring?
- What?

43:24.018 --> 43:25.019
Because of the video?

43:25.102 --> 43:25.936
My goodness.

43:26.020 --> 43:27.396
Or…

43:27.479 --> 43:28.856
Do I look prettier now?

43:45.581 --> 43:48.334
This is insane! Hurry, take her picture.

43:48.959 --> 43:49.793
Hey.

43:49.877 --> 43:52.254
Did you use a marker as an eyeliner?

43:52.338 --> 43:53.881
- This is unbelievable.
- It's crazy.

43:53.964 --> 43:56.675
- Take a picture.
- I'm going to keep this.

43:56.759 --> 43:58.927
- You look so pretty.
- This is gold.

43:59.011 --> 44:01.722
- It's unbelievable.
- Hey, smile.

44:01.805 --> 44:04.350
- They let you leave the house like this?
- She's a beauty.

44:04.433 --> 44:05.893
- Smile!
- You look so pretty.

44:05.976 --> 44:09.229
- What's with your eyeliner?
- Smile for us.

44:09.313 --> 44:10.522
- Hey, smile!
- Smile.

44:10.606 --> 44:11.940
- I'm crying.
- It's ridiculous.

44:12.024 --> 44:13.484
- I'm crying too.
- Look here!

44:15.069 --> 44:17.613
Yes, I need to sell it fast.

44:17.696 --> 44:19.448
We need the money quickly.

44:20.157 --> 44:22.451
As soon as possible, please.

44:22.534 --> 44:23.369
Thank you.

44:34.963 --> 44:36.298
Mom.

44:41.136 --> 44:44.932
What in the world
have you done to your face?

44:45.724 --> 44:47.643
You almost gave me a heart attack.

44:47.726 --> 44:49.478
I just put some makeup on.

44:49.561 --> 44:50.646
Is it that bad?

44:50.729 --> 44:52.272
This isn't makeup.

44:52.356 --> 44:53.690
It's costume makeup!

44:53.774 --> 44:56.276
Did you just get back
from filming a horror movie?

44:56.360 --> 44:57.778
Wash it off immediately!

44:58.320 --> 45:00.280
I'm too embarrassed to go back to school.

45:00.364 --> 45:02.241
Mom, I want to transfer schools.

45:02.324 --> 45:03.659
Will you please let me?

45:03.742 --> 45:06.328
Goodness, you don't have to beg for it.

45:08.580 --> 45:11.291
We're moving back to our old place,
so you have to transfer.

45:11.959 --> 45:13.836
Really? You mean that, right?

45:13.919 --> 45:15.838
Yes!

45:16.422 --> 45:18.882
You really can't read the room, can you?

45:18.966 --> 45:21.218
Read what? I feel like dancing!

45:21.301 --> 45:24.138
I'm transferring schools!

45:24.221 --> 45:27.015
Are you mocking me right now?

45:27.099 --> 45:28.183
I'm home.

45:28.809 --> 45:29.643
You're back.

45:34.314 --> 45:35.899
I almost peed myself.

45:35.983 --> 45:40.237
- Lim Ju-young, I'll kill you.
- Why would you kill my precious son?

45:40.320 --> 45:41.321
Why?

45:49.037 --> 45:50.497
A horror movie?

45:52.708 --> 45:54.334
If I go to school like this…

46:06.555 --> 46:08.390
Is my makeup really that weird?

46:08.474 --> 46:09.308
TEEN GODDESS FORUM

46:09.391 --> 46:11.810
I want to stop being an outcast
before transferring.

46:11.894 --> 46:12.728
Help me out.

46:13.520 --> 46:15.314
- This is awful.
- Are you a ghost?

46:15.397 --> 46:17.232
Do something about your caterpillar brows.

46:17.316 --> 46:18.525
"Caterpillar"?

46:22.863 --> 46:24.615
They do look like caterpillars.

46:25.741 --> 46:27.784
Check out the third most popular post.
It'll help!

46:27.868 --> 46:29.369
"Most popular post"?

46:30.913 --> 46:33.874
Hi, pretty ladies! Here's how to make
your eyes look twice as big.

46:35.501 --> 46:36.627
On one, two, three!

46:42.216 --> 46:43.175
What the…

46:43.759 --> 46:44.760
That's incredible.

46:48.430 --> 46:49.264
Yes,

46:50.265 --> 46:51.475
this is it.

46:59.608 --> 47:03.946
The incident was a huge deal,
almost costing my parents their marriage,

47:04.738 --> 47:08.534
but it was a chance for me
to live a new life.

47:38.063 --> 47:38.897
Welcome.

48:41.335 --> 48:43.962
What perfects your look is the lips.

48:44.046 --> 48:46.465
I'll use this lip tint.

48:46.548 --> 48:47.716
How do I look?

48:47.799 --> 48:49.009
Hey Seluvies,

48:49.092 --> 48:51.428
I hope you managed to
reinvent yourselves today.

48:52.179 --> 48:53.472
Reinvent myself?

48:54.556 --> 48:58.143
Please follow Selena all the way.

49:33.470 --> 49:34.388
Oh, no.

49:35.597 --> 49:36.848
No.

49:36.932 --> 49:37.891
It's okay.

49:38.975 --> 49:40.644
I have to draw them on anyway.

49:40.727 --> 49:41.812
It's okay.

49:41.895 --> 49:42.854
Calm down.

49:45.399 --> 49:47.192
Aren't you going to pack?

49:47.275 --> 49:49.319
What is she up to lately?

49:50.862 --> 49:51.947
Focus.

50:30.068 --> 50:31.361
Unbelievable.

50:36.283 --> 50:37.117
GARDEN OF BLOOD 3

50:42.998 --> 50:44.249
You Are the Devil.

50:46.793 --> 50:48.587
- You Are the Devil.
- What?

50:48.670 --> 50:50.589
- Do you have the latest volume?
- Yes.

50:51.131 --> 50:53.175
I put it in the horror section earlier.

50:54.092 --> 50:55.761
I haven't seen you in a while.

50:56.678 --> 50:58.930
He's always been the same
for the past ten years.

51:05.562 --> 51:06.396
The book…

51:07.731 --> 51:09.191
The first page is ripped.

51:09.274 --> 51:10.192
Sorry?

51:16.198 --> 51:18.533
- The kids who borrowed it must've done it.
- But why?

51:21.369 --> 51:23.455
That's outrageous.

51:26.082 --> 51:29.252
Can't you just skip the first page?

51:29.336 --> 51:32.214
You can still understand the story
even if you skip a page.

51:32.297 --> 51:33.799
When singing the national anthem,

51:33.882 --> 51:36.468
do you skip the first verse
and start from the second?

51:37.302 --> 51:38.595
When you watch soccer games,

51:38.678 --> 51:40.972
do you skip the first half
and start at the second?

51:41.056 --> 51:43.433
You probably skip January
and start the year in February

51:43.517 --> 51:45.393
with that kind of logic.

51:45.477 --> 51:46.728
I see your point.

51:46.812 --> 51:48.104
I'll put in a new order

51:48.188 --> 51:50.899
and let you know immediately,
so if you come by tomorrow…

51:53.568 --> 51:54.861
He never changes.

52:00.492 --> 52:01.409
Ju-kyung.

52:02.118 --> 52:03.912
Wake up. We're almost there.

52:03.995 --> 52:05.413
All right.

52:05.497 --> 52:06.748
PRINCE COMICS

52:16.842 --> 52:17.884
Okay.

52:39.155 --> 52:40.156
Oh, no.

52:53.378 --> 52:54.546
Sorry about that.

53:11.938 --> 53:14.232
Chocolate brown colored lenses, check.

53:17.527 --> 53:21.364
Create some depth to the lids
with light brown eyeshadow,

53:21.448 --> 53:23.867
and finish by dabbing eyeshadow
to the under-eye area

53:23.950 --> 53:26.453
to give the illusion of bigger eyes.

53:27.913 --> 53:30.332
LIM JU-KYUNG

53:31.499 --> 53:34.336
"Good first impression makeup" finished.

53:40.091 --> 53:43.094
I went through so much
to get away from this place.

53:43.178 --> 53:45.889
I thought I had made one step forward,
but now I'm back.

53:45.972 --> 53:47.891
Those eight years went down the drain.

53:48.725 --> 53:51.645
- You've become eight years younger.
- What?

53:51.728 --> 53:54.189
Yes, honey. It's so nice to be back here.

53:54.272 --> 53:56.524
It's romantic and makes me think
of our honeymoon.

53:56.608 --> 53:58.360
Romantic, my foot.

53:58.443 --> 54:00.070
Ju-kyung, come down and eat…

54:09.329 --> 54:11.039
No thanks. I don't feel like eating.

54:11.122 --> 54:12.499
Even if you don't, you…

54:13.667 --> 54:14.542
Who are you?

54:15.126 --> 54:16.211
What?

54:16.294 --> 54:17.837
I'm off to school!

54:22.634 --> 54:24.177
Hey, look. Who is that?

54:24.260 --> 54:25.845
- She's really pretty.
- Who is she?

54:25.929 --> 54:27.931
- I've never seen her.
- She's so pretty.

54:28.014 --> 54:29.391
She's so beautiful.

54:29.474 --> 54:32.310
- She's so pretty.
- She looks like a goddess.

54:32.394 --> 54:33.979
She's stunning.

54:34.062 --> 54:36.231
- She's so pretty.
- I wish I was that pretty.

54:36.314 --> 54:37.440
She's gorgeous.

54:37.524 --> 54:39.192
- Amazing.
- She's stunning.

54:39.275 --> 54:41.152
- She's so pretty.
- My goodness.

54:41.736 --> 54:44.489
SAEBOM HIGH SCHOOL
LIM JU-KYUNG

54:47.242 --> 54:48.368
She's so pretty!

54:48.451 --> 54:49.327
Unbelievable.

54:49.411 --> 54:50.662
She's a true beauty.

54:58.670 --> 54:59.713
Did he just…

55:01.548 --> 55:02.882
call me a true beauty?

55:10.098 --> 55:12.017
- I'm jealous.
- She's so pretty.

55:12.100 --> 55:13.977
- I wish I looked like that.
- Unbelievable.

55:14.060 --> 55:16.229
- I'm jealous.
- She's so pretty.

55:16.312 --> 55:18.356
- She's so pretty.
- Yes, she is.

55:18.440 --> 55:19.983
She's so pretty.

55:20.900 --> 55:22.902
Where's the teachers' office?

55:29.325 --> 55:30.285
What the…

55:39.335 --> 55:40.545
She's beautiful.

55:42.922 --> 55:44.507
STOP ACTING LADYLIKE

55:44.591 --> 55:46.509
STOP ACTING LIKE A MODEL STUDENT

55:46.593 --> 55:48.053
WHAT?
WATCH IT!

55:48.136 --> 55:51.681
You haven't moved that far,
but it still feels rather strange, right?

55:51.765 --> 55:54.350
It's okay. I used to live here
until I was ten years old.

55:54.434 --> 55:55.435
That's good to hear.

55:56.561 --> 55:57.395
Here you go.

55:58.104 --> 56:00.190
You are now a student at Saebom High.

56:00.732 --> 56:01.566
Thank you.

56:04.652 --> 56:05.737
STUDENT ID CARD
SAEBOM HIGH SCHOOL

56:05.820 --> 56:07.489
My goodness!

56:07.572 --> 56:10.909
I hear the new transfer student
was top of the class at their last school.

56:12.118 --> 56:13.870
That must be you, right?

56:14.454 --> 56:15.914
Let me see her files.

56:17.165 --> 56:20.085
Would you look at her?
She looks like a model student.

56:20.168 --> 56:22.462
REPORT CARD

56:23.379 --> 56:24.464
I was wrong.

56:24.547 --> 56:25.632
My goodness!

56:25.715 --> 56:28.176
You must be the top student!

56:28.259 --> 56:29.302
Take a good look.

56:29.385 --> 56:31.805
You can tell he's smart
just by looking at him.

56:32.972 --> 56:34.557
Please excuse us.

56:34.641 --> 56:36.935
Of course, go ahead.
Introduce him to the class.

56:37.018 --> 56:40.396
That's the vice principal.
Don't mind what he said.

56:40.480 --> 56:42.565
There's more to life than your grades.

56:42.649 --> 56:43.775
Okay.

56:43.858 --> 56:44.776
My goodness!

56:44.859 --> 56:47.445
Here comes our top student
in the junior class!

56:47.529 --> 56:49.364
No wonder the room suddenly lit up!

56:49.447 --> 56:50.782
He's really handsome.

56:53.159 --> 56:55.245
Look at him.
Even his greeting is charming.

56:55.328 --> 56:56.246
Just a nod.

56:57.497 --> 56:59.415
- Here you go, sir.
- Thank you.

56:59.499 --> 57:01.668
I feel like I've heard that voice before.

57:01.751 --> 57:03.086
Ask the class president next time.

57:03.920 --> 57:04.754
Okay.

57:04.838 --> 57:08.007
I've never seen
such a handsome face in my life.

57:08.091 --> 57:08.925
Hey, Soo-ho.

57:10.051 --> 57:14.514
She's a new student in our class.
Can you walk her to our classroom?

57:14.597 --> 57:16.599
Must I do that?

57:17.684 --> 57:18.518
Yes,

57:19.144 --> 57:20.854
you must.

57:24.190 --> 57:26.734
- Go after him.
- Okay.

57:27.402 --> 57:28.862
Wait up.

57:29.529 --> 57:30.655
He's so handsome.

57:30.738 --> 57:33.199
On top of that perfect body,
he's the top of the class?

57:33.283 --> 57:35.285
God is really unfair.

57:35.368 --> 57:36.828
Hey, Soo-ho.

57:41.875 --> 57:42.834
Damn it.

57:42.917 --> 57:44.544
It's supposed to be transfer-proof.

57:44.627 --> 57:45.628
Do we know each other?

57:46.963 --> 57:47.881
Why did you say my name?

57:47.964 --> 57:48.840
Soo-ho, I mean…

57:48.923 --> 57:50.133
Do you have a moment?

57:50.216 --> 57:52.677
- I don't have a moment.
- It won't take long.

57:52.760 --> 57:54.095
I have something to tell you.

57:55.680 --> 57:57.056
- You have three seconds.
- What?

57:57.140 --> 57:58.475
- One,
- Soo-ho, I mean…

57:58.558 --> 58:00.310
- two, three.
- I've had a crush on you since…

58:01.060 --> 58:03.396
- My answer is, "No."
- Please at least take this.

58:07.317 --> 58:08.193
LEE SOO-HO

58:16.910 --> 58:18.286
Hey, wait.

58:18.369 --> 58:19.454
What do I do?

58:20.788 --> 58:22.081
Hold on.

58:22.165 --> 58:23.708
Is my makeup still intact?

58:25.919 --> 58:27.045
One, two.

58:30.632 --> 58:32.383
- Hi!
- Soo-ho, you're here!

58:34.594 --> 58:35.887
Hey, hold on.

58:36.804 --> 58:39.224
What's that on your back?
Is that on trend?

58:39.307 --> 58:41.059
It's very cool.

58:41.726 --> 58:44.270
- What is that on his back?
- Isn't it makeup?

58:51.569 --> 58:53.863
Thankfully, my eyes didn't get smudged.

59:03.540 --> 59:04.457
Hey!

59:05.458 --> 59:07.168
What's wrong with him?

59:11.631 --> 59:13.508
I just bought this.

59:15.718 --> 59:18.930
This is your new classmate, Lim Ju-kyung.

59:19.013 --> 59:20.598
Do you want to say hi?

59:21.266 --> 59:23.142
Hi, nice to meet you all.

59:23.226 --> 59:24.561
- You're so pretty!
- Hi.

59:26.980 --> 59:30.149
- You're so pretty!
- Being pretty changed things.

59:30.984 --> 59:32.777
The way people look at me changed.

59:33.361 --> 59:34.779
You're so pretty!

59:34.862 --> 59:35.947
You're pretty!

59:36.030 --> 59:37.615
Except for one person.

59:38.324 --> 59:40.493
The average attractiveness
of our class has gone up now!

59:41.911 --> 59:43.246
- Ahn Hyun-kyu.
- It's gone up.

59:43.329 --> 59:44.539
Don't say such things.

59:44.622 --> 59:47.208
You guys are all beautiful in my eyes.

59:48.001 --> 59:49.419
"Beautiful from far away,

59:49.502 --> 59:50.920
but even more so up close."

59:51.004 --> 59:52.672
That's so lame!

59:52.755 --> 59:55.133
You have no idea how beautiful you are.

59:55.758 --> 59:59.846
Just being 18 years old in itself
is a beautiful and thrilling thing.

59:59.929 --> 01:00:02.807
So don't try to be something you're not.
Especially you, Su-ah.

01:00:02.890 --> 01:00:03.891
Sure.

01:00:04.601 --> 01:00:07.020
Why are you so serious all the time?

01:00:10.023 --> 01:00:11.065
Ju-kyung…

01:00:11.149 --> 01:00:13.151
Right. Take the empty seat next to Soo-ho.

01:00:15.653 --> 01:00:17.530
I have bad eyesight.

01:00:18.031 --> 01:00:19.407
Is that so?

01:00:19.490 --> 01:00:21.367
That seat belongs to a student
who's on leave,

01:00:21.451 --> 01:00:22.785
but how about behind Su-ah?

01:00:23.578 --> 01:00:24.662
Okay.

01:00:28.041 --> 01:00:30.835
Okay, what's your first class?
Mine, right?

01:00:30.918 --> 01:00:32.086
Open your textbooks.

01:00:32.170 --> 01:00:33.296
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

01:00:35.798 --> 01:00:39.761
You do recall the Blue Deer School poets
from the last class, right?

01:00:39.844 --> 01:00:40.887
- No.
- No.

01:00:40.970 --> 01:00:42.722
Of course, you wouldn't recall.

01:00:42.805 --> 01:00:44.474
- Okay, the Blue Deer School.
- Okay.

01:00:44.557 --> 01:00:48.102
With nature as their subject matter,
they pursued human aspirations and values…

01:00:48.186 --> 01:00:50.229
- Here.
- Thank you.

01:00:50.313 --> 01:00:51.898
Pak Tu-jin, Pak Mok-wol, and Cho Chi-hun.

01:00:51.981 --> 01:00:53.900
These three poets formed a club

01:00:53.983 --> 01:00:57.153
and published a book together
called The Blue Deer Anthology.

01:00:59.489 --> 01:01:01.032
Good work, class.

01:01:01.115 --> 01:01:02.784
Make sure to do your homework
by next time.

01:01:02.867 --> 01:01:04.410
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

01:01:04.994 --> 01:01:06.454
It feels so awkward.

01:01:07.830 --> 01:01:09.499
I saw you at the gate this morning.

01:01:09.582 --> 01:01:10.458
You did?

01:01:11.125 --> 01:01:12.669
Hi, new face!

01:01:13.294 --> 01:01:14.212
Hi.

01:01:14.295 --> 01:01:16.130
What's your number? Type it in for me.

01:01:16.756 --> 01:01:17.590
Sure.

01:01:18.424 --> 01:01:20.259
What's your Newstagram handle?

01:01:20.843 --> 01:01:22.261
I don't have an account.

01:01:22.345 --> 01:01:25.014
What? Why not?
Are you trying to be mysterious?

01:01:25.098 --> 01:01:28.017
- You'd get so many Newstagram followers.
- That's right.

01:01:29.268 --> 01:01:31.938
I love your lip color.
Which lip tint do you use?

01:01:32.730 --> 01:01:33.773
Really?

01:01:34.273 --> 01:01:35.650
I use…

01:01:44.283 --> 01:01:46.703
She's stunning.

01:01:46.786 --> 01:01:48.746
She doesn't even seem
to have any makeup on.

01:01:49.372 --> 01:01:50.206
Here.

01:01:51.916 --> 01:01:53.000
Thank you.

01:01:54.127 --> 01:01:55.712
- Kangsu, you're here.
- Yes.

01:01:55.795 --> 01:01:57.213
This is Kang Su-jin, my best friend.

01:01:57.296 --> 01:02:00.675
I think she's the goddess of our school,
but now that you're here, maybe not.

01:02:01.175 --> 01:02:02.051
Watch out, Kangsu.

01:02:02.135 --> 01:02:03.720
Enough with the butt-slapping.

01:02:04.679 --> 01:02:07.056
Ju-kyung, was it? Nice to meet you.

01:02:07.140 --> 01:02:08.266
Nice to meet you too.

01:02:08.349 --> 01:02:10.309
By the way, you're really pretty.

01:02:10.393 --> 01:02:12.103
Are you a trainee or something?

01:02:12.645 --> 01:02:13.980
She talks a lot, doesn't she?

01:02:14.063 --> 01:02:16.023
She's like that. Try to be understanding.

01:02:16.107 --> 01:02:17.650
No, it's okay.

01:02:19.652 --> 01:02:22.822
Granted, it was my fault.
But did he have to throw it to my face?

01:02:23.531 --> 01:02:25.825
I'll get it cleaned all right.

01:02:27.744 --> 01:02:28.578
What?

01:02:29.370 --> 01:02:30.580
But why…

01:02:31.164 --> 01:02:32.623
Why is it not coming out?

01:02:36.919 --> 01:02:39.422
It's waterproof. What do I do?

01:02:40.214 --> 01:02:42.216
This is bad.

01:02:47.472 --> 01:02:48.681
I'm sorry.

01:02:51.017 --> 01:02:53.936
Hey, I'll get this dry cleaned and--

01:02:54.020 --> 01:02:56.063
- Throw it away.
- Sorry?

01:02:56.147 --> 01:02:57.774
Why would you throw it away?

01:02:57.857 --> 01:03:00.234
I'll get it cleaned and return it to you!

01:03:01.068 --> 01:03:02.028
Ju-kyung.

01:03:02.862 --> 01:03:04.071
What's up with Lee Soo-ho?

01:03:04.155 --> 01:03:07.950
I got something on his jacket,
and he wants me to throw it away.

01:03:09.368 --> 01:03:11.204
He's throwing a fit over nothing again.

01:03:11.287 --> 01:03:12.580
That's just how he is.

01:03:12.663 --> 01:03:14.582
He's good-looking, so he's a sociopath.

01:03:14.665 --> 01:03:16.250
Is that so?

01:03:16.876 --> 01:03:18.795
So he's got a rotten temper.

01:03:18.878 --> 01:03:21.672
- Ju-kyung, how about some dumplings--
- Sure, I'll go get them.

01:03:21.756 --> 01:03:22.882
That's not what I meant.

01:03:22.965 --> 01:03:25.510
I was suggesting
that we go get them together.

01:03:26.594 --> 01:03:28.387
- Together?
- Yes.

01:03:31.891 --> 01:03:34.310
You're not giving her space
to make new friends.

01:03:34.393 --> 01:03:37.271
What's the problem?
She's mine from now on.

01:03:37.355 --> 01:03:39.190
You really are outgoing.

01:03:39.273 --> 01:03:40.817
I have to hand it to you.

01:03:40.900 --> 01:03:43.444
By the way, what are you into?

01:03:44.612 --> 01:03:47.240
I do like heavy metal and horror comics…

01:03:48.241 --> 01:03:50.618
- Reading and listening to music.
- What kind of music?

01:03:50.701 --> 01:03:52.078
I'm a huge fan of ATEEN.

01:03:52.161 --> 01:03:53.955
And I love spicy food.

01:03:54.038 --> 01:03:56.290
I love spicy food too.

01:03:56.374 --> 01:03:57.875
Really? That's great!

01:03:57.959 --> 01:04:00.753
Then do you want to get
some tteokbokki after school

01:04:00.837 --> 01:04:02.088
to celebrate our friendship?

01:04:04.173 --> 01:04:05.341
Sounds great,

01:04:06.133 --> 01:04:07.093
friend.

01:04:07.969 --> 01:04:12.473
- You in, Tu-jin?
- Yes. But I'm not Tu-jin, I'm Su-jin.

01:04:12.557 --> 01:04:13.391
Su-jin.

01:04:13.474 --> 01:04:16.811
Sure, Ms. Second-brightest-in-our-school.

01:04:17.395 --> 01:04:19.564
She's neck and neck in grades with Soo-ho.

01:04:19.647 --> 01:04:22.650
She got the looks and the brains.

01:04:22.733 --> 01:04:24.944
You're not like that, are you?

01:04:25.027 --> 01:04:26.112
I'm not smart.

01:04:26.863 --> 01:04:27.780
That's perfect.

01:04:27.864 --> 01:04:30.324
Just stick to your good looks, like me.

01:04:31.993 --> 01:04:33.953
But I'm not pretty.

01:04:34.036 --> 01:04:36.122
Su-ah, you need to study a little.

01:04:36.205 --> 01:04:37.748
- Why?
- I'll help you.

01:04:37.832 --> 01:04:38.916
- We'll do it together.
- No.

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:41.294
- Pretty girls still need to study.
- Whatever.

01:04:41.377 --> 01:04:42.420
Join us, Ju-kyung.

01:04:45.965 --> 01:04:48.134
- All right. You can dig in now.
- Okay.

01:04:48.217 --> 01:04:49.427
- Let's eat.
- Enjoy.

01:04:52.430 --> 01:04:54.098
- How is it?
- It's so good.

01:04:54.181 --> 01:04:55.433
- Right? I told you so.
- Yes.

01:04:55.516 --> 01:04:56.601
I'm going to eat too.

01:04:59.770 --> 01:05:00.771
But it's rather spicy.

01:05:02.815 --> 01:05:05.318
Come on, Su-jin. Just this once. Please?

01:05:05.401 --> 01:05:07.361
- No, I have a tutor coming over.
- Come on.

01:05:07.445 --> 01:05:09.405
Just for ten minutes.

01:05:09.488 --> 01:05:12.825
- I'll get scolded by my mom.
- Just five minutes then. Let's go.

01:05:12.909 --> 01:05:14.744
I can't even spare five minutes for you.

01:05:18.623 --> 01:05:20.458
Ju-kyung, let's try everything in here.

01:05:20.541 --> 01:05:21.709
Got it, Su-jin?

01:05:24.170 --> 01:05:26.088
A NEWBIE IN LIFE
A MASTER IN GAMES

01:05:27.506 --> 01:05:28.925
Did you see? I'm in first.

01:05:29.008 --> 01:05:30.217
How come I can't get any?

01:05:30.301 --> 01:05:31.385
Hey, it's the shark.

01:05:31.469 --> 01:05:32.511
I got it!

01:05:32.595 --> 01:05:33.763
You're almost there.

01:05:35.514 --> 01:05:36.891
Come on!

01:05:39.685 --> 01:05:42.104
You got it! Well done, Ju-kyung!

01:05:47.568 --> 01:05:48.402
Goodness.

01:05:49.820 --> 01:05:50.905
Try it, Ju-kyung.

01:05:50.988 --> 01:05:52.531
- Step right here.
- Here?

01:05:52.615 --> 01:05:53.783
- Like this.
- Like this?

01:05:53.866 --> 01:05:56.243
- Hit the left panel.
- The left?

01:05:57.203 --> 01:05:58.204
You're doing well.

01:06:03.292 --> 01:06:05.127
- Should we take one?
- Sure.

01:06:05.211 --> 01:06:06.212
You look really cute.

01:06:06.295 --> 01:06:07.380
Here we go.

01:06:08.798 --> 01:06:10.132
- Move over.
- Please look here!

01:06:12.385 --> 01:06:14.929
- Is this your first time? Look here.
- I see.

01:06:15.012 --> 01:06:16.389
- Smile!
- Yes. Strike a pose.

01:06:31.445 --> 01:06:34.240
No matter how badly I wanted it
or how hard I tried,

01:06:34.323 --> 01:06:35.950
it had always eluded me.

01:06:38.035 --> 01:06:39.120
Having friends.

01:06:41.789 --> 01:06:44.667
I finally have friends of my own.

01:06:49.839 --> 01:06:50.673
Come on.

01:07:03.102 --> 01:07:04.061
Get up.

01:07:30.588 --> 01:07:33.049
It's been a while for you.
Why push so hard?

01:07:34.050 --> 01:07:35.342
Just because.

01:07:35.426 --> 01:07:36.719
To get better sleep.

01:07:36.802 --> 01:07:38.304
Are you having trouble sleeping again?

01:07:39.889 --> 01:07:41.223
Seems like it's gotten worse.

01:07:45.561 --> 01:07:46.729
Fine, then.

01:07:46.812 --> 01:07:48.647
I'll help you sleep like a baby tonight.

01:07:54.070 --> 01:07:55.237
You need to try harder.

01:07:55.946 --> 01:07:56.989
Hey.

01:07:57.073 --> 01:07:58.365
Come on, it hurts.

01:08:16.258 --> 01:08:18.344
MY FRIEND SU-AH INVITED
MY FRIEND SU-JIN AND LIM JU-KYUNG

01:08:18.427 --> 01:08:20.429
MY FRIEND SU-AH:
DID EVERYONE GET HOME SAFE?

01:08:20.513 --> 01:08:22.973
Is this what they call…

01:08:24.725 --> 01:08:26.185
a "group chat"?

01:08:29.355 --> 01:08:31.398
I'm in a group chat now!

01:08:31.482 --> 01:08:33.400
Did everyone get home safe?

01:08:33.984 --> 01:08:36.195
Yes, what about Su-jin?

01:08:36.278 --> 01:08:41.117
- Kangsu doesn't keep up with the messages.
- I see. By the way, I made a Newstagram.

01:08:41.200 --> 01:08:42.451
My handle is imzoo00_.

01:08:42.535 --> 01:08:44.203
Awesome. Following you right now.

01:08:44.286 --> 01:08:45.412
I'm with my tutor.

01:08:45.496 --> 01:08:48.499
These are photos from today.
Just keep the ones you like.

01:09:06.058 --> 01:09:07.184
What are you doing?

01:09:07.768 --> 01:09:09.979
You are my sister, but I have to say this.

01:09:10.062 --> 01:09:11.564
You're really ugly.

01:09:12.064 --> 01:09:15.276
- What did you say?
- Everyone's calling you a goddess.

01:09:15.901 --> 01:09:17.486
Maybe I should share this picture.

01:09:18.070 --> 01:09:20.030
Lim Ju-young, delete that picture at once!

01:09:20.990 --> 01:09:22.908
Come here! Seriously.

01:09:22.992 --> 01:09:25.077
- Take it if you can.
- Delete it.

01:09:25.161 --> 01:09:27.913
Delete it. I mean it.

01:09:29.123 --> 01:09:30.457
- You punk.
- "You punk."

01:09:30.541 --> 01:09:31.792
- I'll get you.
- "I'll get you."

01:09:31.876 --> 01:09:34.170
What's the matter? It's the real you.

01:09:36.297 --> 01:09:37.840
Do you want this?

01:09:37.923 --> 01:09:39.508
Too slow. Right? Left?

01:09:40.801 --> 01:09:41.969
Let go.

01:09:42.052 --> 01:09:43.345
You're so busted.

01:09:45.848 --> 01:09:47.349
Hey, young lady.

01:09:48.684 --> 01:09:49.852
Where are your manners?

01:10:17.254 --> 01:10:18.339
This is chilling.

01:10:19.757 --> 01:10:22.384
As if a dagger is poised
to pierce my heart.

01:10:23.302 --> 01:10:25.429
But there's no need to worry.

01:10:25.512 --> 01:10:27.556
The hands are faster than the eyes.

01:10:29.308 --> 01:10:32.102
- Come here!
- It hurts! Let go!

01:10:33.687 --> 01:10:35.397
ENTER YOUR PASSCODE

01:10:35.981 --> 01:10:37.775
Do you think I'm stupid?

01:10:45.241 --> 01:10:46.325
What is it you want?

01:10:46.909 --> 01:10:48.327
The latest volume of You Are the Devil.

01:10:48.994 --> 01:10:50.371
Then will you delete it?

01:10:51.163 --> 01:10:52.039
We'll see.

01:10:52.873 --> 01:10:54.541
I could break your wrist off.

01:10:54.625 --> 01:10:56.835
Which one should I upload
to the anonymous forum?

01:10:57.836 --> 01:10:59.004
Don't!

01:11:07.596 --> 01:11:09.932
I'll double your deal.

01:11:13.560 --> 01:11:16.438
How about the new volume and cup noodles?

01:11:18.607 --> 01:11:19.441
Deal.

01:11:42.798 --> 01:11:44.091
What a relief.

01:11:57.980 --> 01:12:00.065
I followed you.
You've uploaded some pictures.

01:12:00.149 --> 01:12:02.735
Gosh, you have tons of likes
when you've just started.

01:12:02.818 --> 01:12:04.153
Really?

01:12:04.862 --> 01:12:06.697
- Can we be friends?
- You're a goddess.

01:12:06.780 --> 01:12:08.741
- Please follow me back.
- Surreal. So pretty.

01:12:08.824 --> 01:12:09.825
I have over 100 likes?

01:12:09.908 --> 01:12:11.577
- You're a goddess.
- You're so pretty.

01:12:12.995 --> 01:12:14.204
"Goddess"?

01:12:15.956 --> 01:12:17.041
There's no way.

01:12:21.920 --> 01:12:23.589
I could run into people from school.

01:12:29.595 --> 01:12:31.221
PRINCE COMICS

01:12:34.391 --> 01:12:35.851
This place hasn't changed a bit.

01:12:37.144 --> 01:12:39.188
I wonder if the owner is the same.

01:12:47.363 --> 01:12:49.198
It still has the same vibe.

01:12:50.324 --> 01:12:51.450
Welcome.

01:12:52.117 --> 01:12:54.495
Hello, sir. You're still here!

01:12:55.579 --> 01:12:58.665
- Who are…
- Don't you remember me?

01:12:59.291 --> 01:13:00.751
Lim Ju-bal?

01:13:00.834 --> 01:13:01.710
Yes, sir.

01:13:02.544 --> 01:13:06.465
You're back.
I heard Ms. Hong was moving back.

01:13:06.548 --> 01:13:07.966
How long has it been?

01:13:08.550 --> 01:13:09.593
About eight years?

01:13:09.676 --> 01:13:11.303
Gosh, has it been that long?

01:13:11.387 --> 01:13:15.265
That little kid has grown up
and you're still…

01:13:15.349 --> 01:13:16.475
Ugly Ju-bal?

01:13:17.059 --> 01:13:18.477
No, you're as cute as ever.

01:13:27.820 --> 01:13:29.405
That's a good one.

01:13:32.908 --> 01:13:34.076
I love the smell of the comics.

01:13:35.953 --> 01:13:36.787
What?

01:13:38.080 --> 01:13:39.873
My scribbles are still here.

01:13:40.666 --> 01:13:44.920
RESERVED FOR LIM JU-KYUNG
SIT HERE AND YOU'LL GROW BUTT HAIR

01:13:49.800 --> 01:13:50.884
This is it.

01:13:51.552 --> 01:13:53.679
There's no other place
with this many horror comics.

01:13:58.016 --> 01:14:00.352
Where is it?

01:14:03.564 --> 01:14:04.398
Found it.

01:14:05.816 --> 01:14:06.984
YOU ARE THE DEVIL

01:14:19.872 --> 01:14:21.123
I got here first.

01:14:21.206 --> 01:14:22.499
I picked it out first.

01:14:52.905 --> 01:14:53.822
Lee Soo-ho?

01:14:56.366 --> 01:14:57.451
You're…

01:14:58.452 --> 01:14:59.661
I'm busted.

01:15:14.343 --> 01:15:16.094
THANK YOU TO LEE TAE-RI
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:15:16.178 --> 01:15:17.971
AND TO CREATORS YEONDUKONG
AND DAMS BEAUTY FOR THEIR HELP

01:15:42.871 --> 01:15:45.499
I'll make sure he'd never even
dream of my being Lim Ju-kyung.

01:15:48.418 --> 01:15:49.628
What if he knows?

01:15:50.128 --> 01:15:51.296
Do you feel guilty or something?

01:15:51.380 --> 01:15:54.007
He'll take pity on me
and not spread the word.

01:15:54.925 --> 01:15:56.760
Hey. You've seen me before, right?

01:15:56.843 --> 01:15:58.971
What kind of absurd coincidence is this?

01:15:59.054 --> 01:16:00.639
Are you seeing Soo-ho?

01:16:01.390 --> 01:16:02.391
Right now?

01:16:02.474 --> 01:16:04.643
You have something for me. Bring it over.

01:16:04.726 --> 01:16:06.645
Lim Ju-kyung without makeup
or with makeup?

01:16:06.728 --> 01:16:09.856
What on earth does he want me to bring?

01:16:09.940 --> 01:16:14.278
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
